  "description": "Line-by-line text reveal that reads like ink pooling into letters: each line is split with SplitText and wrapped in an inner span that starts at a large em-based blur and animates to sharp, while the outer line carries an SVG feColorMatrix alpha-threshold filter that hardens the soft edges into a gooey mass. Three modes per block (on load, once on scroll, scrubbed), Lenis smooth scroll, and banner photos that settle from a slight zoom as they pass.",
